        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"亚叶\"]  ......我没有在指责他们，我只是说......关于“武装感染者”的话题。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "亚叶",
        "content": "......我没有在指责他们，我只是说......关于“武装感染者”的话题。"
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"铃兰\"]  他们会是......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "铃兰",
        "content": "他们会是......"
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"亚叶\"]  那个宪兵提到了“萨卡兹”，这是首先要确定的事情。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "亚叶",
        "content": "那个宪兵提到了“萨卡兹”，这是首先要确定的事情。"
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[name=\"亚叶\"]  如果真的和我们所知道的“感染者武装组织”有关，我们必须警觉起来。这里的情况也许比那个宪兵说的还要复杂。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "亚叶",
        "content": "如果真的和我们所知道的“感染者武装组织”有关，我们必须警觉起来。这里的情况也许比那个宪兵说的还要复杂。"
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[name=\"铃兰\"]  是这样吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "铃兰",
        "content": "是这样吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[name=\"亚叶\"]  如果感染者的情况够好，那只是因为处境还不够绝望。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "亚叶",
        "content": "如果感染者的情况够好，那只是因为处境还不够绝望。"
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[name=\"亚叶\"]  他们肯定还有事情瞒着我们。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "亚叶",
        "content": "他们肯定还有事情瞒着我们。"
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[name=\"铃兰\"]  亚叶姐姐？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "铃兰",
        "content": "亚叶姐姐？"
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"铃兰\"]  不用那么紧张喔，安托姐姐可是很聪明的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "铃兰",
        "content": "不用那么紧张喔，安托姐姐可是很聪明的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[name=\"亚叶\"]  我......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "亚叶",
        "content": "我......"
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[name=\"铃兰\"]  从刚才开始，亚叶姐姐就一直是很可怕的状态嘛。没关系的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "铃兰",
        "content": "从刚才开始，亚叶姐姐就一直是很可怕的状态嘛。没关系的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[name=\"铃兰\"]  只要我们好好努力，就能出色地解决这件事，就像各位干员前辈那样！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "铃兰",
